      "content": "i know i can talk to people, but it doesn't change the fact that the rooms are getting darker. it feels inevitable. like, why fight to stay in a house that's already empty? if the lights are gonna go out anyway, wouldn't it be easier to just... reach for the switch? to just turn them off myself before the darkness takes over?",
